going work emails but also the seamless sharing of insights and resources for improved collaboration.","name":"Netpas Message","packageUrl":"https://www.netpas.net/products/detail/nm","privacyUrl":"https://www.netpas.net/pages/privacyPolicy","publisher":"Seafuture, Inc.","publisherUrl":"https://www.netpas.net/","tags":["email","mail","mailbox"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"您的沟通不止于电子邮件","documentations":[{"DocumentLabel":"快速帮助","DocumentUrl":"https://www.netpas.net/support/quickHelpView/nm"}],"license":"专有软件","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"Netpas Message 是一款专为海事领域设计的邮件系统，在保留传统邮件核心功能的同时显著提升通信效率。该系统能智能解析邮件中的船舶数据，自动存储至 Vessel Manager 数据库，并通过 Open Tonnage 实现数据流转。其特色“项目”功能可按任务自动归类业务邮件，帮助用户聚焦关键工作，实现效率最大化。用户还可将项目共享给团队成员，不仅实现工作邮件的实时同步，更能便捷交流业务见解与资源，打造无缝协作体验。","tags":["电子邮件","邮件","邮箱"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://www.netpas.net/","releaseDate":"2026-11-06","releaseDateSource":"commit","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"6ce4236b2b45e5338d20d730b4147aa6fb699c6d","manifestVersion":"1.28.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/s/Seafuture/NetpasMessage/1.0/Seafuture.NetpasMessage.installer.yaml","sha256":"081aa04d5269ed210f1a0be05b1e85c45bd8aadf2177d6166acf4f9399209db6"},{"path":"manifests/s/Seafuture/NetpasMessage/1.0/Seafuture.NetpasMessage.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"94fb973b9b7027244a27b1472e37d347b779bcbc515cd0525f1f72249dfd86d0"},{"path":"manifests/s/Seafuture/NetpasMessage/1.0/Seafuture.NetpasMessage.locale.zh-CN.yaml","sha256":"8b85389771eb5b6f617d0e87ca35f665ab861cd147fa66c0ebe77905f8b775d7"},{"path":"manifests/s/Seafuture/NetpasMessage/1.0/Seafuture.NetpasMessage.yaml","sha256":"6bd42e976142184452d9c4030c35319f9cb618a29fa19aaa346efe9300b4ce67"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"1.0"}